<h1 style="margin: 0 0 24px 0; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 800; color: #1a1a1a; line-height: 1.2;">Your assignment has ended</h1>

<p style="margin: 0 0 16px 0; font-size: 16px; color: #374151; line-height: 1.6;">Hi,</p>

<p style="margin: 0 0 16px 0; font-size: 16px; color: #374151; line-height: 1.6;"><%= @company_name %> has ended your assignment on <strong style="color: #FE6711;">"<%= @job.title %>"</strong> early<% if @effective_end_display.present? %>, effective <strong><%= @effective_end_display %></strong><% end %>. Any remaining scheduled work on this job has been canceled, so your calendar is free from that point onward.</p>

<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin: 0 0 24px 0; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 8px; border-collapse: separate;">
  <tr>
    <td style="padding: 16px 20px;">
      <p style="margin: 0 0 8px 0; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .04em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #6b7280;">Your pay</p>
      <% if @guaranteed_job_pay %>
        <p style="margin: 0 0 8px 0; font-size: 16px; color: #374151; line-height: 1.6;">This job is <strong>Guaranteed Job Pay</strong>. Ending the assignment early does not reduce your agreed job pay<% if @guaranteed_pay_display.present? %> of <strong><%= @guaranteed_pay_display %></strong><% end %>.</p>
      <% elsif @approved_hours_display.present? && @termination.approved_hours.to_d.positive? %>
        <p style="margin: 0 0 8px 0; font-size: 16px; color: #374151; line-height: 1.6;">You have <strong><%= @approved_hours_display %> approved hours</strong><% if @approved_pay_display.present? %> (<strong><%= @approved_pay_display %></strong> of labor)<% end %> on this job. Those hours remain payable in full and are not affected by the assignment ending.</p>
      <% else %>
        <p style="margin: 0 0 8px 0; font-size: 16px; color: #374151; line-height: 1.6;">No approved hours were recorded on this job, so there is no payable time to release.</p>
      <% end %>
      <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 14px; color: #6b7280; line-height: 1.6;">Payout follows the normal schedule for this job. You will be notified when it is released.</p>
    </td>
  </tr>
</table>

<p style="margin: 0 0 16px 0; font-size: 16px; color: #374151; line-height: 1.6;">You can still leave a review for this company, and reviewing helps release payout sooner.</p>

<%= render partial: 'user_mailer/cta_button', locals: { text: 'View Job', url: @job_url } %>
